  "title": "Experience still has qualitative character",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "424458b4-7bc7-44cb-818b-3c38ed40b0dd",
      "text": "Denying qualia is not denying that experience has a qualitative character. That character is constituted by the sensorimotor contingencies at play, and its features are aspects of the activity of experiencing.",
